        "$s>0$。先在 $[\\varepsilon,R]$ 上分部積分：",
        "$u=x^s$，$dv=e^{-x}dx$",
        "邊界項 $=\\varepsilon^se^{-\\varepsilon}-R^se^{-R}$",
        "• $\\varepsilon\\to0^+$：$\\varepsilon^s\\to0$（因為 $s>0$）",
        "• $R\\to\\infty$：$R^se^{-R}\\to0$（指數贏次方）",
        "兩個積分都收斂（$s>0$、$s+1>0$），取極限：",
        "$s>0$ 用了兩次：邊界項 $\\varepsilon^s\\to0$，以及 $\\Gamma(s)$ 收斂"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int_\\varepsilon^Rx^se^{-x}dx=\\Big[-x^se^{-x}\\Big]_\\varepsilon^R+s\\int_\\varepsilon^Rx^{s-1}e^{-x}dx",
        "\\Gamma(s+1)=s\\,\\Gamma(s)\\qquad(s>0)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "⑤ 在整數點就是階乘",
      "body": [
        "$\\Gamma(1)=1$，一直用遞迴：",
        "定理：$n=0,1,2,\\dots$ 時",
        "證明（數學歸納法）",
        "• $n=0$：$\\Gamma(1)=1=0!$",
        "• 設 $\\Gamma(k+1)=k!$，則 $\\Gamma(k+2)=(k+1)\\Gamma(k+1)=(k+1)!$",
        "所以 $\\Gamma(6)=5!=120$，$\\Gamma(4)=3!=6$",
        "Gamma 函數把階乘延伸到所有正實數；$0!=1$ 也從 $\\Gamma(1)=1$ 得到解釋"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\Gamma(2)=1\\cdot\\Gamma(1)=1,\\quad\\Gamma(3)=2\\cdot\\Gamma(2)=2",
        "\\Gamma(4)=3\\cdot\\Gamma(3)=6,\\quad\\Gamma(5)=4\\cdot\\Gamma(4)=24",
        "\\Gamma(n+1)=n!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "⑥ 讀積分：看到 $x^ke^{-x}$",
      "body": [
        "次方 $k$ ↔ $s=k+1$：",
        "例 1：$\\displaystyle\\int_0^\\infty x^2e^{-x}\\,dx=\\Gamma(3)=2!=2$",
        "例 2：$\\displaystyle\\int_0^\\infty x^4e^{-3x}\\,dx$，令 $u=3x$",
        "$x=\\frac u3$，$dx=\\frac{du}3$，上下限不變：",
        "例 3：$\\displaystyle\\int_0^\\infty x^3e^{-x^2}\\,dx$，令 $u=x^2$",
        "$du=2x\\,dx$，$x^3dx=x^2\\cdot x\\,dx=\\dfrac u2\\,du$",
        "$x\\ge0$ 時 $u=x^2$ 單調遞增，$0\\to0$、$\\infty\\to\\infty$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int_0^\\infty x^ke^{-x}\\,dx=\\Gamma(k+1)",
        "\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{u^4}{3^4}e^{-u}\\frac{du}{3}=\\frac{\\Gamma(5)}{3^5}=\\frac{24}{243}=\\frac8{81}",
        "\\begin{aligned}\\int_0^\\infty x^3e^{-x^2}dx&=\\frac12\\int_0^\\infty ue^{-u}du\\\\&=\\frac12\\Gamma(2)=\\frac12\\end{aligned}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "重點整理",
